# 🚗 Day 17 – AI Vehicle Cost & Fuel Analysis Dashboard

## Overview
Built an AI-assisted dashboard that transforms raw vehicle CSV data into interactive visual insights. The project focuses on analyzing fuel consumption, vehicle operating costs, mileage, and maintenance expenses to support better decision-making.

## Execution
- Imported and explored the vehicle CSV dataset.
- Cleaned missing, duplicate, and inconsistent data.
- Calculated fuel cost, cost per kilometer, mileage, and maintenance metrics.
- Performed exploratory data analysis to identify trends and compare vehicle performance.
- Created an interactive dashboard with KPI cards, charts, and filters.
- Used Claude AI to assist with data analysis, visualization ideas, and insight generation.

## Features
- Fuel Cost Analysis
- Mileage Comparison
- Vehicle Cost Breakdown
- Maintenance Analysis
- Interactive Charts & KPIs
- AI-Generated Insights

## Tech Stack
- Python
- Pandas
- Plotly
- Streamlit
- Claude AI

## Outcome
Successfully converted raw CSV data into an interactive dashboard that provides clear insights into vehicle performance, fuel efficiency, and overall operating costs.
